HB0331 Taking of predators on public lands.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Schmid, Brown, G, Larson, JT,
McCann, Singh, Storer and Webber and Senator(s)
Hutchings
AN ACT relating to game and fish; prohibiting persons from harassing, injuring
or killing predatory animals with vehicles on public lands; authorizing persons
to harass, pursue, hunt, shoot or kill predatory animals with or by use of
vehicles on private lands as specified; requiring rulemaking; and providing for
effective dates.
